Jongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T08:14:33Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T08:14:33Z","body":"I think this is a fantastic UX improvement, but the PR needs a bit more work I think? can I suggest to make the margin lines not the same color as the bounding box, perhaps a darker or more transparent orange, and have the lines stop at the margin edge instead of at the edge of the control?\r\n<img width=\"190\" height=\"140\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-10-01 at 10 13 18\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d37d33c-f23e-4766-9703-aa63859acdcd\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3355237199/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":4,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3357024664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111095#issuecomment-3357024664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111095","id":3357024664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IGCGY","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T15:42:17Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T15:42:17Z","body":"I can certainly implement that later today!\r\n\r\nSomething of a side note: I noticed while working on this that the orange color is not theme-based or customizable, but instead hard-coded in. It's out of scope for this PR but I could see people wanting to be able to customize it for different themes. As such, it might be good to have those colors be made theme-dependent.\r\n\r\nAt the very least, moving them from an inline definition to a constant definition somewhere that various code files could reference would be nice – I'm currently just copying the color definition from its original location, which means the two of them could fall out of sync easily...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3357024664/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358056251","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111095#issuecomment-3358056251","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111095","id":3358056251,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IJ987","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T20:38:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T20:38:21Z","body":"I've changed the rendering of the inner space:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1662\" height=\"884\" alt=\"CleanShot 2025-10-01 at 13 24 53@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83aa1f4b-4fd4-4c32-9de8-4dbee9f125c4\" />\r\n<img width=\"1806\" height=\"860\" alt=\"CleanShot 2025-10-01 at 13 25 02@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e248710-7d9b-4ae6-b41a-922edc7914cf\" />\r\n\r\nUnfortunately I have found that it no longer updates the visualization automatically, when one of the theme properties is changed; the user has to force a redraw by moving their mouse over the viewport, or do something similar. Back in the CanvasItemEditor hardcoded version, it looks like the redraw-queueing was done as a result of the process notification. Would that be the best approach to take here? In retrospect it seems like it could be a bit demanding","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358056251/reactions","total_coun